{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implemented in commit 5d66f7a6f04 (worktree bug-7279-cred-argv, from gerrit main c924c0ea2e8): fetch URL without userinfo; Basic header via URL-scoped http.<base>/.extraHeader in GIT_CONFIG_* env on the Gerrit fetch only, appended after inherited entries; GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0. New tests (8) fail 7/8 on the old code and pass on the fix. Live check 22:25 PST: clone_change_ref of change 3530 with this machine's Gerrit credential fetched the current revision; a ps sampler (332 samples, counts only) saw the Gerrit git fetch 35 times and the credential, its encodings, URL userinfo or extraHeader 0 times. make verify running before push."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795414961369352001,"uuid":"2394f12d-45f8-4a44-976f-12b67f3561de"}